WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.801
-Russia launched a full-scale

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:04.834
military assault
on Ukraine last night

00:00:04.834 --> 00:00:07.133
that shocked and horrified
almost everyone in the world,

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:08.734
except, apparently,
for the leader

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:10.133
of the Republican Party,
Donald Trump.

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:12.400
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.701
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:19.467
If you are like me or like
most people around the world,

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:20.601
you were watching the news

00:00:20.601 --> 00:00:22.300
of Russia's attack on Ukraine
last night

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.267
with a sickening feeling
in your stomach,

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:26.567
a mix of grief and sorrow
and despair

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:29.300
at the mass human suffering
this atrocious act will cause.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.934
No one, aside from Putin
and his cronies,

00:00:31.934 --> 00:00:33.834
wants this reckless
and illegal war.

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:36.501
Certainly not the innocent
Ukrainians targeted by it,

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:38.000
not the rest of the world
watching it,

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.100
and not the hundreds
of ordinary Russians

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.767
who took to the streets
to protest,

00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:44.400
despite a total ban
on such demonstrations.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.400
So, if you're like most people,
you were shocked and horrified.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.701
But if you were Donald Trump,

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:50.534
apparently,
you were at Mar-A-Lago,

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:53.100
watching it with a bunch
of Palm Beach plastic surgeons

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.100
and their third wives
and thinking,

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.467
"You really got to hand it
to Vladimir Putin."

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:07.000
[ Guest laughs ]

00:01:18.534 --> 00:01:20.033
First of all,
stop talking about everything

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:21.667
like it's a [bleep]
real estate deal.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:24.400
[ Laughter ]
It's an illegal war
against a sovereign nation,

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.133
not an empty lot
in Atlantic City.

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:29.601
[ Laughter ]
Second, if you --
if you ever find yourself

00:01:29.601 --> 00:01:31.534
at a fancy,
high-dollar fundraiser,

00:01:31.534 --> 00:01:33.000
clinking champagne glasses

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.667
while the keynote speaker
applauds

00:01:34.667 --> 00:01:37.367
an illegal and catastrophic war
that will cause mass suffering

00:01:37.367 --> 00:01:39.133
and destabilize
an entire continent,

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:41.267
maybe take a moment to text
your therapist and ask...

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.133
Of course, then your therapist
will just text you back...

00:01:48.467 --> 00:01:49.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:51.701
...and you won't hear
that text notification

00:01:51.701 --> 00:01:54.267
because you'll be yelling
at the waiter about your salmon

00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:56.534
or, I don't know, chanting,
"Lock her up," for no reason

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:57.534
[ Laughter ]
because, you know,

00:01:57.534 --> 00:01:59.834
you're a bad person.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:01.400
Trump then went on
to brag, once again,

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.834
about how close he is
with the guy

00:02:02.834 --> 00:02:04.367
who is currently
waging a violent

00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:06.534
and unprovoked assault
on a neighboring country.

00:02:06.534 --> 00:02:08.767
But in the process, he,
as usual,

00:02:08.767 --> 00:02:10.434
rambled his way into talking

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:11.701
about something
completely different

00:02:11.701 --> 00:02:13.901
and pointed out one
of the people in attendance,

00:02:13.901 --> 00:02:17.100
GOP Congressman Ronny Jackson,
his former White House doctor.

00:02:29.901 --> 00:02:32.567
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:34.667 --> 00:02:36.367
[ Laughter ]
-Yikes! I would not want to be

00:02:36.367 --> 00:02:38.367
Dr. Ronny in that situation.

00:02:38.367 --> 00:02:40.400
[ As Trump ]
My two best friends are
Vladimir Putin,

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:42.801
one of the most reviled men
on Earth,

00:02:42.801 --> 00:02:45.200
who is currently in the midst
of waging an illegal war

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.968
that has shocked and angered
the entire world, you know;

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:49.601
and of course, Dr. Ronny.

00:02:49.601 --> 00:02:51.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.167 --> 00:02:55.133
You guys are my best buds,
my crew, Vlad and Ron.

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:56.934
I love them because they're
interchangeable.

00:02:56.934 --> 00:02:58.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.167 --> 00:02:59.634
Ronny, got up and wave
to everyone,

00:02:59.634 --> 00:03:01.734
so they can see the man
I consider equal,

00:03:01.734 --> 00:03:03.367
in every way, to Vladimir Putin.

00:03:03.367 --> 00:03:04.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.701 --> 00:03:06.667
It's like an underling
getting called out for praise

00:03:06.667 --> 00:03:08.267
at a Legion of Doom
cocktail party.

00:03:08.267 --> 00:03:09.667
"Okay, who's here?
We got Lex Luthor.

00:03:09.667 --> 00:03:11.634
Great to see you, Lex.
Brainiac. Welcome, Brainiac.

00:03:11.634 --> 00:03:14.300
And, of course, who could forget
Dave from accounting?

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.267 --> 00:03:16.667
Dave, you are just as important

00:03:16.667 --> 00:03:18.234
to the Legion of the Doom
as the rest of us.

00:03:18.234 --> 00:03:19.868
Let's give Dave a round
of applause.

00:03:19.868 --> 00:03:21.100
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.801
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:23.801 --> 00:03:24.934
While the rest of you are
out there,

00:03:24.934 --> 00:03:26.901
robbing banks
and building ray guns,

00:03:26.901 --> 00:03:28.234
Dave is keeping the lights on."

00:03:28.234 --> 00:03:29.567
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:31.367
If you thought Trump's response
to the crisis

00:03:31.367 --> 00:03:32.968
couldn't get any more sickening,

00:03:32.968 --> 00:03:35.167
he later called in
to Fox News Live,

00:03:35.167 --> 00:03:36.667
as the invasion was happening,

00:03:36.667 --> 00:03:37.968
and found a way to connect it

00:03:37.968 --> 00:03:40.267
to his unhinged claims
about the 2020 election.

00:03:40.267 --> 00:03:42.067
-A month ago or three weeks ago,

00:03:42.067 --> 00:03:45.033
all the so-called experts
were saying that, you know,

00:03:45.033 --> 00:03:47.534
Putin was probably going
to just be content

00:03:47.534 --> 00:03:50.334
with staying
in those separatist regions.

00:03:50.334 --> 00:03:53.033
But I think,
given what's unfolded,

00:03:53.033 --> 00:03:56.400
sadly, with a lot of weakness
in the United States,

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.100
they just decided to go for it.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.567
I mean, it looks like
they're going for it

00:04:00.567 --> 00:04:04.501
and where does that leave
the NATO alliance?

00:04:04.501 --> 00:04:05.734
-I think you're exactly right.

00:04:05.734 --> 00:04:06.868
I think that's what happened.

00:04:06.868 --> 00:04:09.367
He was going to be satisfied
with a piece

00:04:09.367 --> 00:04:11.734
and, now, he sees the weakness
and the incompetence

00:04:11.734 --> 00:04:14.267
and the stupidity
of this administration.

00:04:14.267 --> 00:04:16.734
And, as an American,
I'm angry about it

00:04:16.734 --> 00:04:18.434
and I'm saddened by it

00:04:18.434 --> 00:04:20.934
and it all happened
because of a rigged election.

00:04:20.934 --> 00:04:21.701
[ Laughter ]
-How does he do it?

00:04:21.701 --> 00:04:23.968
How does he find a way

00:04:23.968 --> 00:04:26.467
to connect everything
to his rigged election [bleep]?

00:04:26.467 --> 00:04:29.400
It's like his version
of Six Degrees of Kevin Bacon.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.000
[ Laughter ]
Let's see. Putin is from Russia,

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.234
just like Black Widow,
played by Scarlett Johansson,

00:04:33.234 --> 00:04:35.267
who starred in "Marriage Story"
with Laura Dern,

00:04:35.267 --> 00:04:37.367
who is in "Big Little Lies"
with Reese Witherspoon,

00:04:37.367 --> 00:04:38.534
who was in the movie "Election,"

00:04:38.534 --> 00:04:39.801
which was rigged.

00:04:39.801 --> 00:04:41.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.267
And, by the way...

00:04:42.267 --> 00:04:44.234
[ Cheering ]

00:04:44.234 --> 00:04:47.734
...the same guy who called
our current leaders stupid,

00:04:47.734 --> 00:04:49.167
later in that same interview,

00:04:49.167 --> 00:04:53.000
got confused and thought
Americans had launched

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.767
an amphibious attack in Ukraine,

00:04:54.767 --> 00:04:56.067
which he started
complaining about

00:04:56.067 --> 00:04:58.334
until FOX host Laura Ingraham
corrected him

00:04:58.334 --> 00:04:59.801
and told him
it was actually a report

00:04:59.801 --> 00:05:03.367
about a potential amphibious
assault by Russia, not the U.S.

00:05:03.367 --> 00:05:05.200
-President Trump.
-Energy independent

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.601
and he blew it.

00:05:06.601 --> 00:05:08.434
-We're just learning
that U.S. officials

00:05:08.434 --> 00:05:12.167
are looking at a potential
amphibious landing, now,

00:05:12.167 --> 00:05:14.534
in Odessa, Ukraine.

00:05:14.534 --> 00:05:16.000
-That's a very sad thing,

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.834
but you know what's also
very dangerous is

00:05:17.834 --> 00:05:21.968
you told me about the amphibious
attack by Americans.

00:05:21.968 --> 00:05:23.334
You shouldn't be saying that

00:05:23.334 --> 00:05:25.834
because you and everybody else
shouldn't know about it.

00:05:25.834 --> 00:05:28.601
They should do that secretly,
not be doing that

00:05:28.601 --> 00:05:30.534
[ Laughter ]
through the great
Laura Ingraham.

00:05:30.534 --> 00:05:32.133
They should be doing
that secretly.

00:05:32.133 --> 00:05:34.400
Nobody should know that, Laura,
and, you know,

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:37.000
you or nobody should know.
-No, that was the Russians.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.801
-No, those are the Russians,
the Russian amphibious landing.

00:05:39.801 --> 00:05:40.901
-Well,
I thought you said that --

00:05:40.901 --> 00:05:41.901
I thought you said that

00:05:41.901 --> 00:05:43.234
-No, no.
-we were sending people in.

00:05:43.234 --> 00:05:44.133
[ Laughter ]
Oh, okay.
-No, I did not.

00:05:44.133 --> 00:05:45.267
-Alright.
-No, no, no, no, no.

00:05:45.267 --> 00:05:47.267
-Oh, okay, good.
-That would be news.

00:05:47.267 --> 00:05:48.167
That would be news.

00:05:48.167 --> 00:05:49.334
No.
-And you know what?

00:05:49.334 --> 00:05:50.467
That's all we need.

00:05:50.467 --> 00:05:52.033
That'll be next, okay?

00:05:52.033 --> 00:05:54.000
[ Laughter ]

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.834
-That guy was commander-in-chief

00:05:55.834 --> 00:05:57.901
of the United States
Armed Forces for four years.

00:05:57.901 --> 00:06:00.167
[ Laughter ]
You know, I think, even when we
were in grade school

00:06:00.167 --> 00:06:02.100
and they told us anybody
could grow up to be president,

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:05.033
we thought to ourselves,
"Well, I'm sure not anybody.

00:06:05.033 --> 00:06:07.334
[ Laughter ]
I mean, Timmy keeps going

00:06:07.334 --> 00:06:08.968
to the nurse
for chuggin' paste."

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:09.934
[ Laughter ]

00:06:09.934 --> 00:06:12.133
But now,
we literally have to admit

00:06:12.133 --> 00:06:13.767
it could be anybody.

00:06:13.767 --> 00:06:14.601
[ Laughter ]

00:06:14.601 --> 00:06:16.000
Honestly, I'd be surprised

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.734
if he even knows
what amphibious meant.

00:06:17.734 --> 00:06:19.901
[ As Trump ]
Laura, I was confused
because America, of course,

00:06:19.901 --> 00:06:21.834
has the greatest amphibious
forces in the world --

00:06:21.834 --> 00:06:24.968
soldiers who can fight with both
their right and left hands...

00:06:24.968 --> 00:06:26.734
[ Laughter ]

00:06:26.734 --> 00:06:29.367
...which is very useful if you
only have left-handed grenades.

00:06:29.367 --> 00:06:32.000
[ Laughter ]
"Um, I think -- I think
you mean ambidextrous."

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.601
[ As Trump ] Oh, okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:34.601 --> 00:06:37.234
Ingraham even criticized
Ukrainian President Zelensky

00:06:37.234 --> 00:06:38.968
for pleading with Russia
and imploring them not

00:06:38.968 --> 00:06:39.868
to attack his country.

00:06:39.868 --> 00:06:41.267
He was desperately trying

00:06:41.267 --> 00:06:42.901
to stop
the catastrophic invasion

00:06:42.901 --> 00:06:44.100
that would cause misery
and death,

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:45.734
but Ingraham
just didn't like it.

00:06:45.734 --> 00:06:49.634
-We had a kind of a really
pathetic display from the

00:06:49.634 --> 00:06:53.067
Ukrainian President Zelensky
earlier today, President Trump,

00:06:53.067 --> 00:06:54.601
where he, in Russian --

00:06:54.601 --> 00:06:57.000
he doesn't like to speak
Russian, but in Russian --

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:00.267
he was essentially
imploring Vladimir Putin

00:07:00.267 --> 00:07:03.968
not to invade his country.

00:07:03.968 --> 00:07:06.801
Now, we basically have
the Ukrainian ambassador

00:07:06.801 --> 00:07:11.367
to the United Nation Nations
looking like a defeated man.

00:07:11.367 --> 00:07:12.868
-What would you say is
more pathetic,

00:07:12.868 --> 00:07:14.634
trying to stave off
a Russian invasion

00:07:14.634 --> 00:07:16.000
that would cause mass suffering
and death

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.400
by speaking
in a second language

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:19.834
or having to explain to a former
president live on television

00:07:19.834 --> 00:07:21.534
that it was Russia
and not America

00:07:21.534 --> 00:07:22.667
who is reportedly launching
[ Laughter ]

00:07:22.667 --> 00:07:24.501
a secret amphibious assault
in Ukraine?

00:07:24.501 --> 00:07:26.100
I'd ask these people
how they sleep at night,

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:27.734
but I'm guessing they own
a MyPillow,

00:07:27.734 --> 00:07:29.033
which means
they don't sleep at all.

00:07:29.033 --> 00:07:30.734
[ Laughter ]
Have you ever tried sleeping

00:07:30.734 --> 00:07:31.434
on one of those things?

00:07:31.434 --> 00:07:32.567
Not only are they filled

00:07:32.567 --> 00:07:34.567
with packing peanuts
and broken glass,

00:07:34.567 --> 00:07:37.868
but there's also a tiny
little voice box in each one

00:07:37.868 --> 00:07:39.534
that plays
soothing sleep sounds

00:07:39.534 --> 00:07:41.267
personally recorded
by Mike Lindell.

00:07:41.267 --> 00:07:42.634
[ Laughter ]
-We already have

00:07:42.634 --> 00:07:43.968
all the pieces of the puzzle.

00:07:43.968 --> 00:07:46.400
When you talk about evidence,
we had enough evidence

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.000
to put everybody in prison
for life,

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.033
300 and some million people,

00:07:51.033 --> 00:07:54.167
[ Pop, deflating,
distorted voice fades ]

00:07:54.167 --> 00:07:56.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:00.834 --> 00:08:01.868
-A lot of work went into that.

00:08:01.868 --> 00:08:02.968
A lot of work went into it.

00:08:05.901 --> 00:08:08.267
You maybe also heard her mention
the Ukrainian ambassador

00:08:08.267 --> 00:08:10.467
looking like a "defeated man."

00:08:10.467 --> 00:08:12.834
Here's what he was actually
saying to the Russian ambassador

00:08:12.834 --> 00:08:14.634
at a meeting
of the UN Security Council,

00:08:14.634 --> 00:08:16.534
as the Russian attack
was happening.

00:08:16.534 --> 00:08:21.033
-Call Putin, call Lavrov
to stop aggression

00:08:21.033 --> 00:08:23.234
and I welcome the decision

00:08:23.234 --> 00:08:27.901
of some members of this council

00:08:27.901 --> 00:08:29.300
to meet as soon as possible

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:32.501
to consider
the necessary decision

00:08:32.501 --> 00:08:34.534
that would condemn
the aggression

00:08:34.534 --> 00:08:38.834
that you launch on my people.

00:08:38.834 --> 00:08:41.968
There is no purgatory
for war criminals.

00:08:41.968 --> 00:08:44.434
They go straight to hell,
Ambassador.

00:08:44.434 --> 00:08:47.334
You never hear language
like that at the United Nations,

00:08:47.334 --> 00:08:48.501
unless it's Model UN.

00:08:48.501 --> 00:08:49.634
Those kids hold nothing back.

00:08:49.634 --> 00:08:51.334
[ Laughter ]

00:08:51.334 --> 00:08:52.801
For real, one time,
when I was in Model UN,

00:08:52.801 --> 00:08:55.434
in sixth grade,
I moved to table the motion

00:08:55.434 --> 00:08:57.067
to consider Lithuania's
membership

00:08:57.067 --> 00:08:59.100
to the Council
for Ecological Preservation

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.467
and the ambassador from Belgium
was so mad,

00:09:01.467 --> 00:09:04.467
he put his Capri Sun straw
right through my hand!

00:09:04.467 --> 00:09:05.501
[ Laughter ]

00:09:05.501 --> 00:09:06.734
I still have the scar.

00:09:06.734 --> 00:09:08.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:12.534 --> 00:09:13.801
Went all the way through.

00:09:13.801 --> 00:09:15.901
[ Laughter ]

00:09:15.901 --> 00:09:17.968
[ Applause ]

00:09:19.734 --> 00:09:21.934
And, even when they're not
openly praising Putin

00:09:21.934 --> 00:09:25.000
or denigrating Ukraine,
Republicans have all rallied

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:28.200
around this insane idea
that Biden's "weakness"

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.434
somehow invited
Russian aggression.

00:09:30.434 --> 00:09:34.067
-To see the way
the Biden administration

00:09:34.067 --> 00:09:37.567
has handled Ukraine

00:09:37.567 --> 00:09:40.767
is a testament
to a historic truth --

00:09:40.767 --> 00:09:42.534
that weakness arouses evil.

00:09:42.534 --> 00:09:44.133
-I don't think they know
what they're doing.

00:09:44.133 --> 00:09:46.601
-Yeah
-They are in way, way,

00:09:46.601 --> 00:09:48.000
over their heads.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.334
I mean, Putin played this

00:09:50.334 --> 00:09:54.067
almost like
a symphony conductor

00:09:54.067 --> 00:09:56.200
and he had --

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:59.367
and he basically made Biden --

00:09:59.367 --> 00:10:01.434
he kind of stretched it out
to make Biden

00:10:01.434 --> 00:10:03.033
look more and more foolish.

00:10:03.033 --> 00:10:05.334
Now, Putin's an evil man.
-Yeah.

00:10:05.334 --> 00:10:09.033
-But Putin is a brilliant man.

00:10:09.033 --> 00:10:11.133
I mean, as soon
as Biden came in,

00:10:11.133 --> 00:10:14.567
he and Xi said, you know,
"Let's test him.

00:10:14.567 --> 00:10:15.634
He looks like a weakling.

00:10:15.634 --> 00:10:16.934
He's always been a weakling."

00:10:16.934 --> 00:10:19.067
-Yeah. You know,
you def want to get advice

00:10:19.067 --> 00:10:20.234
on how not to get played

00:10:20.234 --> 00:10:21.934
from the guy
who unwittingly ended up

00:10:21.934 --> 00:10:24.234
with the third-biggest
speaking role in "Borat."

00:10:24.234 --> 00:10:25.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:25.634 --> 00:10:27.767
I mean, this guy doesn't know
where he is half the time.

00:10:27.767 --> 00:10:29.367
You're asking for his take
on a conflict

00:10:29.367 --> 00:10:31.334
halfway around the world,
meanwhile, he can't even find

00:10:31.334 --> 00:10:33.067
the Four Seasons Hotel
in Philadelphia.

00:10:33.067 --> 00:10:35.300
[ Laughter ]
When you asked him about Putin,

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.767
he probably thought
you were talking

00:10:36.767 --> 00:10:38.200
about French fries and gravy,

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:39.701
[ Laughter ]
which, who are we kidding?

00:10:39.701 --> 00:10:41.834
Rudy definitely calls poutine
French fries and gravy.

00:10:41.834 --> 00:10:42.968
[ Laughter ]

00:10:42.968 --> 00:10:44.100
[ As Giuliani ]
French fries and gravy.

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:45.400
I mean, that's a taste
that goes together

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:46.400
like me and my cousin.

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.434
[ Laughter ]

00:10:47.434 --> 00:10:48.634
We were married.

00:10:48.634 --> 00:10:51.067
I didn't know at the time,

00:10:51.067 --> 00:10:52.200
but as soon as I found out --

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:54.133
14 years into it.
Anyway,

00:10:54.133 --> 00:10:56.534
[ Laughter ]
Joe Biden doesn't have a clue.

00:10:56.534 --> 00:10:59.400
Russia's brutal and illegal act
of military aggression

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.167
will create
mass human suffering,

00:11:01.167 --> 00:11:03.100
which is why the world
must do everything possible

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:06.000
to alleviate that suffering,
including taking in refugees,

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.601
helping the innocent displaced
people caught up in this war,

00:11:08.601 --> 00:11:10.934
and imposing severe sanctions
to get Russia to stop.

00:11:10.934 --> 00:11:12.634
And, as for people
like Trump and Rudy...

00:11:12.634 --> 00:11:16.334
-They are in way, way,
over their heads.

00:11:16.334 --> 00:11:17.534
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:17.534 --> 00:11:21.367
♪♪

00:11:21.367 --> 00:11:22.834
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:11:22.834 --> 00:11:24.300
over two million meals a year

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:26.567
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:11:26.567 --> 00:11:28.067
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:11:28.067 --> 00:11:30.067
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:11:30.067 --> 00:11:32.234
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:11:32.234 --> 00:11:34.801
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

